tion buttons, including a \"danger\" style, are being styled with hover effects to provide visual feedback to user interaction. The terminal body will take up available space and maintains a minimal height. The terminal element itself ensures complete use of the parent container space.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy/desktop_app/templates/index.html\"","EndLine":"1180","StartLine":"1008","toolAction":"\"View existing AI servers CSS\"","toolSummary":"\"View lines 1008-1180 in index.html\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
